            "category_label": "Éden",
            "lesson_id": "lesson-2",
            "lesson_label": "Leçon 2 — Éden"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "source_block",
              "lines": [
                "1. \tJehova akanungunika alipoona shamba lake (shamba lile)(shamba lile lenye kutoa matunda yenye kunyauka) 2x"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "refrain",
              "lines": [
                "Mimi sijui kazi gani sikutimiza kwa shamba langu mimi (shamba langu) ni kapanda ni kamimia maji kwayo kutoa matunda mema, shamba langu likatoa matunda mbaya yote yenye kunyauka."
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "source_block",
              "lines": [
                "2. Ni kiwa na hatia mbele yako mungu wangu unirehemu (ni fundishe) ni fundishe ginsi upendavio mungu wangu unirehemu."
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "source_block",
              "lines": [
                "3. Sina lingine tegemeo ila wewe ni mwamba wangu (moyo wangu) moyo wangu mikononi mwako ni tendee ginsi upendavio."
              ]
            }
          ],
          "media": {
            "audio_present": false
          }
        }
      ]
    },
